{"4421310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crimswell", "steam_appid": 4421310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Far from the capital with no real prospects, you stumble upon a rare opportunity: a beat-up bar going for dirt cheap. In that small roadside town, you're stepping into a business that'll take you straight into the heart of crime and nightlife, building an empire of bars, brothels, and backyard distilleries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/659a93f1ddd9717c6e6066f3f9318c2e.poster.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/659a93f1ddd9717c6e6066f3f9318c2e.webm?t=1782522671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/659a93f1ddd9717c6e6066f3f9318c2e.mp4?t=1782522671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Craft drinks in unimaginable ways, mixing all sorts of wild and sketchy ingredients. Discover and create recipes unlike anything else.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/8bb986cd9fae313dca951f7d71733017.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>Serve your customers, deliver drinks, or take on <strong>shady deals</strong> for underground goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/4aa23bb4c6585433de971870f65899a7.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>That run-down bar was just the start. <strong>Expand</strong> with new properties, <strong>hire</strong> employees, and <strong>automate</strong> your whole production and distribution operation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/a3cb3169fa33c0996ea8aee9bfef7788.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>Growing this business ain't easy. You're gonna face all kinds of heat: <strong>cops</strong> on one side, rival <strong>gangs</strong> on the other. Use whatever you got to hold your ground.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/032e52daa1023cb0d9493806d4cb7c49.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>In the underworld, it's not all beefs there's fun too. How about some illegal <strong>street races</strong> against San Paul's hottest drivers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/85fac2a76dccb11a6832b543f8040dde.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>And there's nothing better for this grind than having your crew with you. <strong>Play co-op</strong> with <span class=\"bb_strike\">up to 4</span> friends...  <strong>up to 8</strong> if you're down for chaos.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Far from the capital with no real prospects, you stumble upon a rare opportunity: a beat-up bar going for dirt cheap. In that small roadside town, you're stepping into a business that'll take you straight into the heart of crime and nightlife, building an empire of bars, brothels, and backyard distilleries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/659a93f1ddd9717c6e6066f3f9318c2e.poster.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/659a93f1ddd9717c6e6066f3f9318c2e.webm?t=1782522671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/659a93f1ddd9717c6e6066f3f9318c2e.mp4?t=1782522671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Craft drinks in unimaginable ways, mixing all sorts of wild and sketchy ingredients. Discover and create recipes unlike anything else.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/8bb986cd9fae313dca951f7d71733017.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>Serve your customers, deliver drinks, or take on <strong>shady deals</strong> for underground goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/4aa23bb4c6585433de971870f65899a7.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>That run-down bar was just the start. <strong>Expand</strong> with new properties, <strong>hire</strong> employees, and <strong>automate</strong> your whole production and distribution operation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/a3cb3169fa33c0996ea8aee9bfef7788.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>Growing this business ain't easy. You're gonna face all kinds of heat: <strong>cops</strong> on one side, rival <strong>gangs</strong> on the other. Use whatever you got to hold your ground.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/032e52daa1023cb0d9493806d4cb7c49.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>In the underworld, it's not all beefs there's fun too. How about some illegal <strong>street races</strong> against San Paul's hottest drivers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421310/extras/85fac2a76dccb11a6832b543f8040dde.avif?t=1782522671\" width=1560 height=300 /></span>And there's nothing better for this grind than having your crew with you. <strong>Play co-op</strong> with <span class=\"bb_strike\">up to 4</span> friends...  <strong>up to 8</strong> if you're down for chaos.</p>", "short_description": "turn a run-down bar into a full-blown criminal operation. Craft drinks unlike anything else, take shady deals, and expand with illegal properties. Survive the heat from cops and rival crews while you rule the streets of Crimswell. Play solo or with up to 8 friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/